equip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%83%E7%AC%83%E9%AA%A8\" title=\"笃笃骨\"><img alt=\"笃笃骨\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%83%E7%AC%83%E9%AA%A8\" title=\"笃笃骨\">笃笃骨</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>非理性迷宫</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：310403</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">技能一</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/笃笃骨大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/笃笃骨大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/追击.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/追击 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3104/310403/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">在第一枚预兆落下的时候，她得到了启示。<br />那是某种遥远而含糊的预言，借由清晨的太阳、闪光的露水、脚趾间的蛰痛来完成传递。舞者必须进行一场永不休止的舞蹈，哪怕双脚布满鲜血，也不能就此停止——直至神明回应，直到命运朝她展露另一种好运的预兆。<br />但不是每个舞者都能拥有被回应的幸运，她将自我坠入一场严酷的修行，每当最煎熬的时刻来临，她就会将自己想象成一枚骰子，在就此放弃还是祈祷下一秒得到回应间摇摆，在休憩的诱惑下享受苦痛，在大成功与大失败之间煎熬折磨。此时，门扉那侧，响起了轻轻的敲门声。<br />“夏洛特，你还好吗？”<br />很可惜，这是任何沉浸派玩家必然会面临的意外情况——来自亲友的关心。就在她准备放弃仪式欲作答时，命运朝她丢出了第二枚幸运的骰子。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"310403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f5/Belonging-310404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">铜油灯<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bronze Oil Lamp</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />80<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一盏普通的铜制油灯。<br />法师曾托举过以龙脂为油的黄金灯，也曾仅仅握着一只火把起舞。在被问及为何最终选择了毫无特色的铜油灯时，她答道：“它既没妨碍奥术施展，也没让我的舞步踉跄。就像我现在的表情不妨碍你继续就这些没意义的话题提问一样。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8f/Belonging-310405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“头上的布”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Veil Upon My Head\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />65<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>兼具美丽与实用功能的装备，能够防御一次巨龙吐息。<br />游戏开始前，为“减少给装备取名造成的时间浪费”，冒险者执意如此称呼它。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9f/Belonging-310406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">舞者铃饰<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bell-Lined Dancer's Belt</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>饰有铃铛的腰饰与脚镯。传闻这位法师从古老的异域生物那里习得了失传之奥秘，以和着铃声与火光的舞步代替吟唱，拥有击退邪魔的强大力量。<br />另一方面，清脆的铃音也完美掩饰了假肢落地时的“笃笃”声。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"i